  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Syria Regional Appeal - HQ - Emergency preparedness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA will maintain an up-to-date preparedness plan and will need to acquire certain assets that will facilitate operational readiness. The component is designated for emergency response to unforeseen regional displacements throughout the year, including situations such as stranded Gazans and the movement of PRL/PRS to Jordan, triggered by regional escalations affecting Syria, Lebanon, and Jordan. This allocation replaces the previously planned PRS-specific cash assistance in Gaza, as the PRS response is now incorporated into the broader Gaza emergency response.</narrative>
  </description>
